{"id":"rumbo","lemma":"rumbo","pos":"noun","rank":2134,"glosses":["course","heading, bearing"],"ipa":"/ˈrumbo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"rumbos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/61/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-rumbo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Hemos cambiado el rumbo.","en":"We've altered course.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454400","words":[{"g":"heme","l":"hemo"},{"g":"changed"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"El barco cambió de rumbo.","en":"The ship changed its course.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"boat"},{"g":"to change","l":"cambiar"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Navegamos rumbo sur.","en":"We're sailing southward.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/630265","words":[{"g":"to navigate, to sail","l":"navegar"},null,{"g":"south"}]},{"text":"Caminé sin rumbo por la calle.","en":"I walked about aimlessly on the street.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689307","words":[{"g":"to walk","l":"caminar"},{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"street"}]},{"text":"Dimos vueltas sin rumbo por el barrio comercial.","en":"We wandered aimlessly around the shopping district.","words":[{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"go-back"},{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"neighbourhood"},{"g":"commercial"}]}]}